OL,3,GNEWSAWork on controversial #2.35m cycle
OL,4,Apath stopped
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork on a controversial #2.35m cycle
OL,7,Fpath has been paused after a council
OL,8,Frevoked its own permission to build it.
OL,10,FBath and North East Somerset Council
OL,11,Fbegan work on the cycle lane at Royal
OL,12,FVictoria Park in Bath on 19 October
OL,13,Fdespite objections from people
OL,14,Fconcerned about the safety of it.
OL,16,FHowever, on 22 October the council
OL,17,Frevoked the formal order permitting the
OL,18,Fscheme as it admitted it had missed a
OL,19,Fmajor objection because of a "technical
OL,20,Fand administrative oversight".
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
